":"劉寅","start":8,"end":10,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0035","surface":"胡諧之","start":35,"end":38,"person_id":"2yz_7xj_cx7","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0039","surface":"茹法亮","start":39,"end":42,"person_id":"u4m_so3_3c0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0075","surface":"法亮","start":75,"end":77,"person_id":"u4m_so3_3c0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0175","surface":"子響","start":175,"end":177,"person_id":"kix_r92_2ed_G","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0209","surface":"劉寅","start":209,"end":211,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0214","surface":"席恭穆","start":214,"end":217,"person_id":"2d4_2ed_646","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0227","surface":"江愈","start":227,"end":229,"person_id":"d5w_9gh_95i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0230","surface":"殷曇粲","start":230,"end":233,"person_id":"enp_k0f_r76","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0237","surface":"周彥","start":237,"end":239,"person_id":"no5_agf_v1r","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-040-zixiang:p005:m0244","surface":"寅","start":244,"end":245,"person_id":"zoy_74m_fbk","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"